  "title": "The Other Scott",
  "subtitle": "\"The reclusive billionaire invited two journalists to her Capri villa. She neglected to mention the other invitee was my ex.\"",
  "penName": "Alice Scott",
  "genre": "enemiesToLovers",
  "hook": "The invitation arrived on letterhead I had not seen since 1994: Vesper Amherst Holdings, the private foundation of the most reclusive woman in American media. I was Alice Scott, senior feature writer at The New Yorker. The invitation said I would receive the exclusive story of a lifetime if I came alone to Capri for three weeks. I was met at the villa by Vesper's assistant. Ten minutes later, Hayden Anderson walked in carrying a Bowery Mission duffel bag. Hayden, whose last email to me had been an apology I had not answered. My college boyfriend. The other journalist.",
